{"seq":52,"slug":"secrets-configuration-management","title":"密钥与配置管理","stage":"DONE","category":"cs-fundamentals","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/h/cs-fundamentals/secrets-configuration-management","rating":{"composite":3.57,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.6,"coverage":3.5,"positioning":3.5,"strategic":3.67},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introMarkdown":"# 密钥与配置管理\n\n任何一段会被部署的代码，迟早都要回答两个问题：它运行时该读哪些参数，以及那些参数里最敏感的几条该如何被保护。前者是配置，后者是密钥。把数据库连接串里的主机名换掉是配置变更，把里面的密码泄露出去则可能是一起安全事故——同一个字符串的两半，命运截然不同。这个 hub 要讲的，正是如何系统地区分、存放、分发并长期守护这两类数据，让一套服务能在开发、预发、生产之间平滑迁移，又不会在某次 `git push` 里把生产密钥送上公网。\n\n整个 hub 按四章层层递进，每一章都建立在前一章的概念之上。\n\n第一章「基础」打地基。它先讲清「配置应当与代码分离」这条十二要素方法论的核心主张，再界定配置与密钥的边界以及由此推出的威胁模型，最后讲多个配置来源如何层叠、谁覆盖谁。读完这一章，你会拥有一套贯穿全 hub 的词汇：什么算配置、什么算密钥、一个值最终从哪里来。\n\n第二章「密钥管理」聚焦那一小撮最敏感的数据如何被守护。它从静态存储与保险库（Vault 一类系统）讲起，深入到静态与传输加密、信封加密与 KMS 的密码学机制，再到动态密钥与自动轮换——让密钥不再是一个长期不变、一旦泄露就灾难性的常量，而是短命的、可随时作废的凭据。\n\n第三章「分发与注入」解决「把值安全送到运行实例」的工程问题。配置与密钥存得再好，最终都要进入进程的内存。这一章对比环境变量、文件挂载与 sidecar 注入三条路径，讲配置中心（Consul、etcd）如何支撑热更新，再讲特性开关如何把「改配置」变成一种不用重新部署的运行时控制手段。\n\n第四章「运维」着眼长期保障。前三章把系统搭好，这一章保证它在岁月里不腐坏：用访问控制与最小权限收紧谁能读什么、用审计日志留下可追溯的痕迹、用密钥扫描在泄露发生前就拦住它、最后用合规框架与全生命周期管理把这一切制度化。\n\n四章连起来是一条清晰的主线：先分清是什么（基础），再守护最敏感的部分（密钥管理），然后安全地送达（分发与注入），最后长期维持（运维）。建议按顺序阅读，但每一篇也都通过交叉链接指向相关主题，方便你随时跳转。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"foundations","title":"基础","docCount":3,"url":"/h/cs-fundamentals/secrets-configuration-management/foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"config-fundamentals","title":"配置管理基础与十二要素应用","url":"/h/cs-fundamentals/secrets-configuration-management/foundations/config-fundamentals"},{"seq":2,"slug":"config-vs-secrets","title":"配置与密钥的区分及威胁模型","url":"/h/cs-fundamentals/secrets-configuration-management/foundations/config-vs-secrets"},{"seq":3,"slug":"sources-precedence","title":"配置来源、层叠与优先级","url":"/h/cs-fundamentals/secrets-configuration-management/foundations/sources-precedence"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"secrets-management","title":"密钥管理","docCount":3,"url":"/h/cs-fundamentals/secrets-configuration-management/secrets-management","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"secret-storage-vault","title":"密钥存储与保险库（Vault 等）","url":"/h/cs-fundamentals/secrets-configuration-management/secrets-management/secret-storage-vault"},{"seq":2,"slug":"encryption-rest-transit","title":"静态与传输加密、信封加密与 KMS","url":"/h/cs-fundamentals/secrets-configuration-management/secrets-management/encryption-rest-transit"},{"seq":3,"slug":"dynamic-secrets-rotation","title":"动态密钥与自动轮换","url":"/h/cs-fundamentals/secrets-configuration-management/secrets-management/dynamic-secrets-rotation"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"distribution","title":"分发与注入","docCount":3,"url":"/h/cs-fundamentals/secrets-configuration-management/distribution","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"config-injection","title":"配置注入：环境变量、文件与 sidecar","url":"/h/cs-fundamentals/secrets-configuration-management/distribution/config-injection"},{"seq":2,"slug":"config-centers","title":"配置中心：Consul、etcd 与热更新","url":"/h/cs-fundamentals/secrets-configuration-management/distribution/config-centers"},{"seq":3,"slug":"feature-flags","title":"特性开关与运行时配置","url":"/h/cs-fundamentals/secrets-configuration-management/distribution/feature-flags"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"operations","title":"运维","docCount":3,"url":"/h/cs-fundamentals/secrets-configuration-management/operations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"access-control-audit","title":"访问控制、最小权限与审计","url":"/h/cs-fundamentals/secrets-configuration-management/operations/access-control-audit"},{"seq":2,"slug":"secret-scanning","title":"密钥泄露扫描与防护","url":"/h/cs-fundamentals/secrets-configuration-management/operations/secret-scanning"},{"seq":3,"slug":"compliance-lifecycle","title":"合规与密钥全生命周期","url":"/h/cs-fundamentals/secrets-configuration-management/operations/compliance-lifecycle"}]}]}